    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tiens, salut ! Tu te souviens de moi ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe suis la parfumeuse qui cherche à élaborer\nde nouvelles fragrances, à l’aide d’échantillons<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 156
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et justement, j’ai une nouvelle idée de parfum !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500740020006A0075007300740065006D0065006E0074002C0020006A20190061006900200075006E00650020006E006F007500760065006C006C006500200069006400E90065002000640065002000700061007200660075006D0020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette fois j’aimerais utiliser les flocons de neige\nque Sorbébé rejette lorsqu’il respire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelle odeur peut bien exhaler ce Pokémon aussi\nblanc et léger que de la crème glacée... ? Aaah...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’espère que tu pourras m’amener un Sorbébé !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900650073007000E800720065002000710075006500200074007500200070006F007500720072006100730020006D20190061006D0065006E0065007200200075006E00200053006F0072006200E9006200E90020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu as un Sorbébé, mets-le dans ton équipe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006900200074007500200061007300200075006E00200053006F0072006200E9006200E9002C0020006D006500740073002D006C0065002000640061006E007300200074006F006E002000E9007100750069007000650020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, tu m’as amené un Sorbébé ! Merci !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C0020007400750020006D20190061007300200061006D0065006E00E900200075006E00200053006F0072006200E9006200E9002000210020004D00650072006300690020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Laisse-moi récupérer un peu de sa neige !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610069007300730065002D006D006F00690020007200E900630075007000E900720065007200200075006E00200070006500750020006400650020007300610020006E00650069006700650020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brrr... Que c’est froid ! J’ai lu que son souffle\natteint -50 °C...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200720072002E002E002E0020005100750065002000632019006500730074002000660072006F00690064002000210020004A2019006100690020006C0075002000710075006500200073006F006E00200073006F007500660066006C0065000A00610074007400650069006E00740020002D00350030002000B00043002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La neige n’a pas d’odeur normalement, mais je\nsuis sûre que la neige de Pokémon en a une !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai fini mon parfum de Sorbébé !\nVoici « Crème de Neige » !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610069002000660069006E00690020006D006F006E002000700061007200660075006D00200064006500200053006F0072006200E9006200E900200021000A0056006F006900630069002000AB00200043007200E8006D00650020006400650020004E0065006900670065002000BB0020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Figure-toi que la neige de Sorbébé a une légère\nodeur sucrée !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004600690067007500720065002D0074006F006900200071007500650020006C00610020006E006500690067006500200064006500200053006F0072006200E9006200E90020006100200075006E00650020006C00E9006700E800720065000A006F00640065007500720020007300750063007200E900650020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il suffit de humer ce parfum pour ressentir une\nvive sensation de fraîcheur de la tête aux pieds !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En d’autres termes...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020006420190061007500740072006500730020007400650072006D00650073002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais faire un malheur dans la région tropicale\nd’Alola ! Les parfums de Pokémon sont l’avenir !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Leur potentiel est illimité ! Lorsque j’aurai\nma prochaine idée, j’espère que tu m’aideras !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les parfums de Pokémon ont un potentiel infini !\nJ’espère que tu continueras à m’aider !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
